{"unit_id":"Letter2025__dsh-tool-search#card-zh","repo":"Letter2025/dsh-tool-search","commit":"bb79135c5fcc5ae742badc2ef1b5c2432d7b02fa","type":"card","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:41-65","src/engine.ts:99-135","src/bridge.ts:54-134","src/matcher.ts:24-125","src/setup.ts:114-210"],"text":"**dsh-tool-search** 是 DeepSeek Harness 的工具搜索与精简插件，通过 system-prompt/assemble 按工具目录大小和令牌预算，将长尾工具收纳到分组清单，并保留核心工具及搜索、描述、调用三个桥接工具。用户或项目可配置分组与 rerank 匹配器；搜索在匹配器不可用时退回关键词排序。模型可按需查找工具、读取完整参数并调用真实工具，已发现工具会在会话后续轮次中动态显示。插件还提供配置管理工具、对话式设置技能、可选首轮预加载，以及 PTC/SDK 声明适配，适合工具目录庞大、希望减少每轮上下文开销的 DSH 使用者。"}
{"unit_id":"Letter2025__dsh-tool-search#card-en","repo":"Letter2025/dsh-tool-search","commit":"bb79135c5fcc5ae742badc2ef1b5c2432d7b02fa","type":"card","lang":"en","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:41-65","src/engine.ts:99-135","src/bridge.ts:54-134","src/matcher.ts:24-125","src/setup.ts:114-210"],"text":"dsh-tool-search trims DSH's visible tool catalog to fit a token budget while keeping core tools ready. The model can search deferred tools by rerank or keywords, load schemas, and invoke tools; discovered tools remain visible in later turns. Groups, preload, and PTC declarations are supported."}
