{"unit_id":"Letter2025__dsh-tool-search#feature-search","repo":"Letter2025/dsh-tool-search","commit":"bb79135c5fcc5ae742badc2ef1b5c2432d7b02fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/matcher.ts:72-125","src/bridge.ts:54-75"],"text":"**dsh-tool-search** 的功能「搜索长尾工具」：模型提交查询后，插件用已配置的 rerank 接口排序；没有匹配器或请求失败时改用关键词匹配，并返回工具名称、说明和分组。"}
{"unit_id":"Letter2025__dsh-tool-search#feature-disclosure","repo":"Letter2025/dsh-tool-search","commit":"bb79135c5fcc5ae742badc2ef1b5c2432d7b02fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/disclosure.ts:47-57","src/disclosure.ts:76-111","src/engine.ts:114-134"],"text":"**dsh-tool-search** 的功能「按预算披露工具」：每轮根据上下文窗口和清单预算，选择完整分组说明、仅名称或分组计数清单；核心工具保持直接可见。"}
{"unit_id":"Letter2025__dsh-tool-search#feature-bridge","repo":"Letter2025/dsh-tool-search","commit":"bb79135c5fcc5ae742badc2ef1b5c2432d7b02fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/bridge.ts:77-134","src/index.ts:53-64"],"text":"**dsh-tool-search** 的功能「加载并调用工具」：模型可读取单个延迟工具的完整参数，或用名称和参数执行真实工具；桥接层返回结果或可见错误信息。"}
{"unit_id":"Letter2025__dsh-tool-search#feature-warm","repo":"Letter2025/dsh-tool-search","commit":"bb79135c5fcc5ae742badc2ef1b5c2432d7b02fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/engine.ts:243-265","src/engine.ts:274-282"],"text":"**dsh-tool-search** 的功能「会话内动态加载」：搜索、描述或调用后的工具会加入当前会话的可见集合，并按配置的上限淘汰较早加载的工具。"}
{"unit_id":"Letter2025__dsh-tool-search#feature-setup","repo":"Letter2025/dsh-tool-search","commit":"bb79135c5fcc5ae742badc2ef1b5c2432d7b02fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/setup.ts:114-177","src/setup.ts:180-210"],"text":"**dsh-tool-search** 的功能「对话式配置」：设置技能读取完整工具目录并协助分组，用户确认后可写入用户级或项目级配置，包含匹配器与可选预加载设置。"}
{"unit_id":"Letter2025__dsh-tool-search#feature-ptc","repo":"Letter2025/dsh-tool-search","commit":"bb79135c5fcc5ae742badc2ef1b5c2432d7b02fa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/ptc.ts:18-46","src/sdk.ts:115-128","src/engine.ts:130-134"],"text":"**dsh-tool-search** 的功能「PTC 工具清单精简」：在严格 PTC 模式保留 `run_code` 传输工具，并重绘 SDK 声明区域，仅列出当前披露的核心与桥接工具。"}
